{
  "description": "The creature is depicted in right-facing profile standing upright on two hind legs against a plain light background, with two large wings spread outward to the sides. It has a large feline head with a shaggy mane around the neck, a densely feathered neck and chest, a spotted feline torso, hindquarters and long tail, and broad feathered wings attached at the shoulder region. The overall coloration is warm tan and golden-brown with darker brown spots on the body and legs and layered brown and tan feathers on the wings and chest, rendered in detailed illustrative style.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "a large feline head with tan fur, a yellow eye with dark pupil, a dark pinkish-brown nose, white fur on the chin and lower muzzle, small dark whisker spots, and a closed mouth",
      "where": "at the front upper end of the body, facing to the right in profile"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two small rounded ears with light tan outer fur and darker brown interior shading",
      "where": "on top of the head, set into the mane, one more visible in profile than the other"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "a thick shaggy ruff of long, tousled hair in light brown and golden-tan, with individual strands visible",
      "where": "encircling the back and sides of the head and extending down the back and sides of the neck to the upper chest"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "two muscular hind legs covered in tan fur with dark brown rosette spots, bent at the hock and stifle joints",
      "where": "extending downward from the lower torso to the ground, supporting the upright posture"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "large rounded paws with four visible toe pads and short blunt claws, tan with spotted patterning on the dorsal surface",
      "where": "at the bottom ends of the two hind legs, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "a long slender tail covered in tan fur with dark spots, ending in a bushy dark brown to black tuft",
      "where": "projecting from the rear of the torso, curving down then up in a hook shape"
    },
    {
      "part": "wings",
      "looks_like": "two broad outstretched wings with layered feathers, the right wing (viewer's left) fully visible and the left wing (viewer's right) partially visible behind the body",
      "where": "attached at the shoulder and upper back region, extending laterally outward from the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "feathers",
      "looks_like": "dense overlapping feathers; small pointed scale-like feathers on the neck and upper chest transitioning to larger flight feathers on the wings, colored in shades of golden-brown, tan, cream and dark brown with darker tips and barred patterning on the primaries",
      "where": "covering the neck, upper chest, and the entire dorsal and ventral surfaces of both wings"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "dark brown to black rosette and solid spots of varying size densely scattered over tan fur, with a lighter less-spotted underbelly, and scalloped mottled brown patterning within the feathered areas",
      "where": "covering the torso, hind legs, and tail, and as feather patterning on the neck, chest and wings"
    }
  ],
